commit bd4b7434e6bdb588c7ef55706ff8904cb7fd4c57
Author: GoodOlClint <goodolclint@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 29 15:02:37 2026 -0500

    Add optional seed to GenerateParameters for reproducible sampling (#377)
    
    Add optional seed to GenerateParameters for reproducible sampling
    
    TopPSampler and CategoricalSampler each create a private RandomState seeded from DispatchTime.now(), making temperature > 0 sampling non-reproducible and ignoring MLXRandom.seed.
    
    Adds seed: UInt64? to GenerateParameters, threaded through sampler() into each sampler's RandomState(seed:). Fully backward-compatible: nil preserves the existing entropy-seeded behavior; argmax is unaffected. A fixed seed makes (seed, prompt, parameters) deterministic, and per-request seeds in GenerateParameters make this concurrency-safe with no shared global RNG.
    
    Tests cover: same-seed determinism for both samplers, distinct-seed divergence, seed threading through GenerateParameters, and nil-seed preservation.

