commit 4cea9e5bec33f99d75bc90981034255c6a38338d
Author: Alessio Pollero <alessio.pollero@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 29 21:47:52 2026 +0400

    Support correlated tool call transcripts (#360)
    
    Support correlated tool call transcripts
    
    Add tool-call IDs so assistant tool calls and tool results can be
    correlated in transcripts.
    
    - Add optional `ToolCall.id`; parsers (JSON/Llama3/Mistral) extract
      supplied ids, including OpenAI-style top-level and nested forms
    - Add `Chat.Message.Tool` metadata and `MessageGenerator.addToolMetadata`,
      emitting OpenAI-style `tool_calls` / `tool_call_id`; wire through all
      six VLM generators and `DefaultMessageGenerator`
    - ToolCallProcessor dedups and regenerates ids per turn, with
      format-aware generation (9-char for Mistral, `call_`-prefixed default)
    - ChatSession pairs each tool result with its originating call id

