commit ce06d362321740f51d1e40afaf0d55be799f9708
Author: surawatthana <surawatthana@hotmail.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 29 19:34:05 2026 +0200

    Skip vision_embedder weights in Gemma4Model.sanitize (#366)
    
    The gemma4_unified 12B safetensors include a top-level vision_embedder
    submodule alongside the existing embed_vision / vision_tower keys. Without
    this entry in the skip list, Gemma4Model.sanitize leaves those weights in
    the dictionary and loadWeights aborts with:
    
        Unhandled keys ["vision_embedder"] in Gemma4Model
    
    Add vision_embedder to the prefix filter so language-only loading of the
    12B unified model succeeds.
    
    Co-authored-by: Sura Watthanalamlert <sura.watthanalamlert@dkbcodefactory.com>
    Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>

